00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.767
-Yes, Jimmy.

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:56.133
In this game, I will read each of you a mind-blowing fact.

00:00:56.133 --> 00:01:00.367
And you must decide if that fact is true or false.

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.534
[Echoing] If you choose wrong,

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:07.734
