00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.467 --> 00:01:12.701
You will be blasted in the face

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:14.968
from the front of the tube in front of you.

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:19.334
Make the right choice, and your opponent gets their mind blown.

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:21.601
-Before we start, let's give ourselves

00:01:21.601 --> 00:01:24.467
